### Get PMPJ Risk Config
GET {{baseUrl}}/pmpj/risk-config
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get PMPJ
GET {{baseUrl}}/pmpj/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update PMPJ
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pmpj/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
"Nama": "Test User",
"Jabatan": "Direktur",
"Alamat": "Test Address",
"BeneficialOwner": "Test Beneficial Owner",
"NamaPerusahaan": "Test Company",
"AlamatPerusahaan": "Test Company Address",
"ProfilPenggunaJasa": "Pengusaha/Wiraswasta",
"ProfilDomisili": "DKI Jakarta",
"TahunPeriode": "2025",
"KategoriPenggunaJasa": "Pengusaha/Wiraswasta",
"KategoriBisnisPenggunaJasa": "Manufaktur",
"KategoriDomisiliPenggunaJasa": "DKI Jakarta",
"KategoriKhususTambahan": "Tidak ada kriteria lainnya"
}

### Update PMPJ — with KTP
### Test lewat REST/CURL agak sulit buat upload file begini, lbh baik lewat UI
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pmpj/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FileKTP"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../test_upload/test.pdf
------FormBoundary--

### Get KTP File
GET {{baseUrl}}/pmpj/1/file-ktp
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}